-[Open Jev experiments](https://jev-experiments.vercel.app). This is the deployed source for the experiment gallery around things people can manipulate, play, hear, compare, and inspect. It contains 29 experiment pages, shared light/dark/system themes, and three shareable layouts on the same routes.
+[Open Jev experiments](https://jev-experiments.vercel.app). This is the canonical application source for the Jev lab. The current source wires 41 catalog entries, opens with a playable material canvas, and supports light, dark and system themes. Detailed model settings, tools and evidence remain available within each study.
 
